.TH SSGRID 1 2000-1月 "sgrid_simulate" "sgrid_simulate"
.SH NAME
sgrid_simulate \- integrate the fitted S-system model and return the trajectory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsgrid_simulate(\fBnetwork\fR as <generic> SSystemNetwork, 
\fBfinal_time\fR as double = 0, 
\fBcontext\fR as list = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBgenes\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
integrate the fitted S-system model and return the trajectory
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBnetwork\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfinal_time\fB \fR\- 
 the final time of the integration, zero means the end of the fitted time axis.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBcontext\fB \fR\- 
 the optional initial state of the ODE integration, this value should be in 
 the model state space(see also: [ssGrid.sgridContext()](cref:M:biosystem.ssGrid.sgridContext(SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SGrid.GRN.SSystemNetwork,System.Object,System.String,SMRUCC.Rsharp.Runtime.Environment))), the first 
 sample point of the fitted time series will be used if this parameter is 
 not provided.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgenes\fB \fR\- 
 the optional gene list that returns in the trajectory table.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a dataframe, the first column \fB#Time\fR is the time axis.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
let baseline = sgrid_simulate(network, context = sgrid_context(network, counts));
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ssGrid
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
